# MIMO: replies spoken through the MIMO voice relay (docs/mimo-tts.md).
# Load after the board's overlay: MIMO_TTS=1 tools/muse/board.sh build s3.
# No relay URL or token here: they're set on the device (mimo.tts.url,
# mimo.tts.token) and kept in its NVS, never in a build.
CONFIG_MIMO_TTS=y
